        "TileImage": "$($repository 252428ca-3f8e-4477-b2b9-58f18cff3e44).Image",
        "Description": "After tracking down the whereabouts of a TRAVESTY leader known only as Tremaine, we were surprised to find that he is an agent within our very own agency, the ICA. Agent Tremaine is a double agent, feeding information about the ICA to TRAVESTY. This must be how Directive seemed to know about our subtle assassinations of some of their members, and how they knew the assassin behind them was you, 47. ICA does not take this betrayal lightly. There is no room for error with this contract. Good luck.",
